# Tests of NgramTests that fail with the optimizer, see NgramTests.
# Remove a test once it passes; the suite fails while a listed test passes.

# The ngram index lower-cases one code point at a time (İ becomes i), fn:lower-case uses the full case mapping
reference-ngram.xqm: case-mapping-like-fn-lower-case

# Pre-selection evaluates the query once, over the documents, before there is a node to compute it from
parts-on-one-node.xqm: query-computed-from-the-node
